<title>USA: Reckson prices 4.3 mln shrs at $45.25/shr.</title>
<headline>Reckson prices 4.3 mln shrs at $45.25/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp said Tuesday it priced a secondary offering of 4.3 million shares at $45.25 per share.</p>
<p>Reckson said the underwriters elected to exercise the over allotment option to purchase an additional 645,000 shares of common stock. The company said gross proceeds will be about $212 million.</p>
<p>The offering was lead managed by Merrill Lynch, Reckson said.</p>
